Lesson 18: keyof aur typeof
1. keyof kya karta hai?
Maan lo ek object ka type hai:
type User = {
  name: string;
  age: number;
  city: string;
};

type UserKeys = keyof User;


Ab UserKeys ki value-type hogi:
"name" | "age" | "city"


Matlab keyof object ki saari property keys ka union type bana deta hai.
2. typeof kya karta hai?
const user = {
  name: "Rahul",
  age: 25
};

type User = typeof user;


Yahan TypeScript user variable ko dekhkar uska type bana dega:
{
  name: string;
  age: number;
}


Yaad rakhne ka trick:
- keyof → object ki keys nikalo.
- typeof → variable ka type nikalo.
3. Dono ko saath mein use karna
const config = {
  apiUrl: "https://example.com",
  timeout: 5000
};

type ConfigKeys = keyof typeof config;


ConfigKeys banega:
"apiUrl" | "timeout"


Pehle typeof config object ka type nikalta hai, phir keyof uski keys nikalta hai.
